    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway, chemical, meteorological and physical data collected aboard the CCGS Amundsen during the Canadian Arctic Archipelago cruise (EXPOCODE 18DL20150417) from 2015-09-08 to 2015-10-14. These data include partial pressure of carbon dioxide (pCO2), barometric pressure, sea surface salinity and sea surface temperature. The instruments used to collect these data include CO2 gas analyzer and shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous CO2 measurement.",
